## 🎮 Experimental Features

### Keyboard Shortcuts

- `Ctrl/Cmd + Space` - Toggle AI Assistant
- `Ctrl/Cmd + K` - Open Global Search
- `Ctrl/Cmd + M` - Open Mini Games
- `Q` - Toggle Quick Actions menu

### AI Assistant

- Chat interface for code help
- ML-powered suggestions
- Code explanations

### Voice Commands

- "Go to [page]" - Navigate
- "Open [feature]" - Open features
- "Search for [query]" - Search

### Global Search

- Quick page navigation
- Help topics search
- Keyboard navigation (↑↓↵)

### Quick Actions

- Floating action button
- 8 quick shortcuts
- Press Q to toggle

### Mini Games

- Coding Quiz (5 questions)
- Typing Speed Test
- Pattern Memory Game

